{"unit_id":"GZMULDY__dsh-windows-tray#card-zh","repo":"GZMULDY/dsh-windows-tray","commit":"265a66fd31355f4e33a1f0c5e1886e14e760fff3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-windows-tray 是适用于 Windows 桌面端的 DSH 插件，在系统托盘提供鲸鱼图标来控制本机 DSH web 服务。插件激活后启动常驻托盘控制器，并向 DSH 提供状态及启动、停止、重启服务和打开托盘的接口。用户可从托盘菜单打开 Web 界面、启动或停止服务、重启服务、退出托盘，也可查看运行状态。适合希望从 Windows 通知区域管理 DSH web 的用户。需要 Windows、PowerShell 和已安装的 DSH；默认操作本机 3080 端口并打开本地 Web 地址，不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:17-36","lib/tray.js:47-83","lib/tray.ps1:86-130"]}
{"unit_id":"GZMULDY__dsh-windows-tray#card-en","repo":"GZMULDY/dsh-windows-tray","commit":"265a66fd31355f4e33a1f0c5e1886e14e760fff3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-windows-tray adds a Windows tray icon to control the local DSH web service. Its resident controller shows service status and provides start, stop, restart, and browser-open actions. It requires Windows, PowerShell, and DSH, and operates on port 3080.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:17-36","lib/tray.js:47-83","lib/tray.ps1:86-130"]}
