{"unit_id":"GZMULDY__dsh-windows-tray#feature-1","repo":"GZMULDY/dsh-windows-tray","commit":"265a66fd31355f4e33a1f0c5e1886e14e760fff3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-windows-tray 的功能「托盘服务控制」：通过常驻托盘菜单启动、停止或重启本机 DSH web 服务；菜单操作会显示执行结果提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tray.ps1:86-119"]}
